      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that works. could u make the part about the punctuality a bit more specific though? maybe suggest that it's impacting the team's momentum and that i'd like to see them more consistently present at the start of the meeting. can u also add a sentence about how their client work is a model for the rest of the team?",
      "source": "evaluator"
